  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under GASB 33 (par. 7), voluntary nonexchange transactions result from legislative or contractual agreements entered into willingly by both parties, including grants, donations, and entitlements. Neither party is compelled to participate.
Wrong (A): This describes a government-mandated nonexchange transaction, where a higher-level government compels participation rather than both parties entering willingly.
Wrong (B): Property taxes are classified as imposed nonexchange transactions, a distinct category where the government unilaterally levies the charge.
